  "title": "OSMF Biomarker Atlases: biomarkers reported in patients versus controls",
  "description": "<p>Per-condition biomarker atlases: markers reported in patients versus controls, with direction of change, specimen, assay and the source publication for each finding, plus genetic correlates (loci, variants, genes) from the GWAS Catalog.</p><p>Validated against biomarkers.schema.json at build time.</p><p>Live, daily-updated version: <a href=\"https://research.opensourcemed.info/biomarker-atlas.html\">https://research.opensourcemed.info/biomarker-atlas.html</a>. Built from commit bc4bf8e6f83e of the OSMF Research Tracker.</p><p>Research information, not medical advice.</p>",
